    {"entry_index":40,"uid":"zhcn:c67560522a9353008310a861","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"暗い場所で光るトリックについて？\r\nハ、教えるかよ。","source_fingerprint":"d1bd1710e6553701c2f364b3147920a01ff1a34365eafd8df383a1015f08043d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1036","70017"],"target_text":"Mánh phát sáng trong bóng tối ấy hả?\r\nHừ, ai mà nói cho mày biết.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":41,"uid":"zhcn:ff2789d63878864013d1989c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"不管穿着什么去比赛，\r\n推算的结果都不会改变的。","source_fingerprint":"c994871d7d9724ad761264176ab0e625e873bc06d9b2c7fa674c2a6a225a8273","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1036","70018"],"target_text":"Dù mặc gì để đi đua,\r\nkết quả tính toán cũng chẳng thay đổi đâu.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":42,"uid":"zhcn:63921bb81335a6ec41858203","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……顺便收集一下衣服尺寸的数据好了。","source_fingerprint":"9676dbc19f680745ee84e46f680eef494d68091cda5ca84f13743537d2fcfef3","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1036","70019"],"target_text":"…Tiện thể thu thập luôn dữ liệu kích cỡ trang phục vậy.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":43,"uid":"zhcn:7f2c38507935574dd816e883","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"コメントは求めてませーん。","source_fingerprint":"46adb28a9ea70653031301533eaeac56d29c27ed071f5c82f6471e090bdb92d7","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1036","70020"],"target_text":"Tao có hỏi ý kiến đâu nhéー.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":44,"uid":"zhcn:d2b8d295668d03832d34f6d3","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"スニーカー、\r\n一生足りねェ…。","source_fingerprint":"3c0e3108dea787b18f0642a91834fefe08808af646a61db355f09db6a104576a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1036","70021"],"target_text":"Sneaker ấy mà,\r\ncó bao nhiêu cũng chẳng đủ…","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":45,"uid":"zhcn:17d768d4179431493212de67","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"嘛，算是蛮说得过去的设计？","source_fingerprint":"07be2e4813e5bb46857a9bfd9fec223205d1e0ac391ce3a9a8a16ab3ee12fa29","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1036","71004"],"target_text":"Ờ, thiết kế này cũng tạm ổn đấy chứ?","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":46,"uid":"zhcn:bccbe1e62bb121e941d175d0","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"和这身衣服的风格唱反调的话才没效率吧？","source_fingerprint":"f730b6aa0a59e2e8ce6b19b3bf36f508889140066e061396b697438a4a49bcf2","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1036","71008"],"target_text":"Ăn mặc trái hẳn phong cách của bộ này mới là thiếu hiệu quả chứ?","reviewed":true},
